{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Stack-Cairn.LiveAgent","latestVersion":"2.0.17","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 Stack-Cairn","description":"A local-first AI agent desktop client that deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 Stack-Cairn","description":"A local-first AI agent desktop client that deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"LiveAgent is a local-first AI agent desktop client. It deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools, so the AI can genuinely operate your file system, run commands, and manage scheduled tasks — while the Gateway enables remote access and collaboration.","name":"LiveAgent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent","publisher":"Stack-Cairn","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn","releaseNotes":"LiveAgent v2.0.17\n内置 K-brain v0.107.30（#1280）。\n问题修复\n- 启动界面不再无限卡住（#1276）：升级或迁移数据目录后，启动时如果本地服务（K-brain）没有响应，以前会一直停在只有图标和进度条的界面上，没有任何提示和按钮。\n  - 读取设置超过 20 秒，界面会说明情况并提供「重启本地服务」，点击后会换一个新的本地服务进程重新加载；\n  - 历史记录迁移超过 15 秒没有进展，可以选择「跳过，进入应用」（迁移继续在后台进行）或「重启本地服务并重试」；\n  - 迁移的每一步都有时间限制，超时的步骤会在下次启动时重试，不会卡住启动。\n- 迁移数据目录更可靠（#1276）：\n  - 复制期间不会再有重连把本地服务在旧目录上重新拉起，避免迁移后丢失这段时间写入的数据；\n  - 跳过数据目录里的 socket、管道等特殊文件，以前遇到管道时复制会永久卡住；\n  - 扫描旧版会话改为在后台线程进行，不再冻住窗口。\n- kn 终端里运行的会话实时同步到 LiveAgent（#1278）：以前在 kn 里开始的新会话，要等回合结束十几秒后才出现在会话列表里，已经打开的会话也不会刷新。\n  - 现在几秒内就会出现在列表里，运行期间显示转圈；\n  - 已打开的对话会随 kn 的进度依次显示用户消息、工具调用和最终回答；\n  - 运行期间输入框会提示「正在 kn 中运行」并暂时禁止发送，回合结束后恢复。\n内置 K-brain 的变化\n- 会话同步与防止丢消息（K-brain#192）：kn 在回合进行中就保存进度，backend 几秒内就能发现变化；同一会话同时只允许一个进程运行回合，在 LiveAgent 和 kn 同时操作同一会话时不会再互相覆盖消息。\n- 置顶、归档在回合运行中也能使用（K-brain#190，随 v0.107.29 发布）。\n详见 K-brain v0.107.29、v0.107.30 发布说明。\n完整变更：https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/compare/v2.0.16...v2.0.17","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/releases/tag/v2.0.17","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","claude-code","codex","large-language-model","llm","mcp"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个本地优先的 AI Agent 桌面客户端，将大语言模型的推理能力与本地系统工具深度整合。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"LiveAgent 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 桌面客户端。它将大语言模型的推理能力与本地系统工具深度整合，让 AI 能够真正操作你的文件系统、执行命令、管理定时任务，同时通过 Gateway 实现远程访问与协作。","tags":["claude-code","codex","mcp","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"LiveAgent is a local-first AI agent desktop client. It deeply integrates large language model reasoning with local system tools, so the AI can genuinely operate your file system, run commands, and manage scheduled tasks — while the Gateway enables remote access and collaboration.","name":"LiveAgent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent","publisher":"Stack-Cairn","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn","releaseNotes":"LiveAgent v2.0.17\n内置 K-brain v0.107.30（#1280）。\n问题修复\n- 启动界面不再无限卡住（#1276）：升级或迁移数据目录后，启动时如果本地服务（K-brain）没有响应，以前会一直停在只有图标和进度条的界面上，没有任何提示和按钮。\n  - 读取设置超过 20 秒，界面会说明情况并提供「重启本地服务」，点击后会换一个新的本地服务进程重新加载；\n  - 历史记录迁移超过 15 秒没有进展，可以选择「跳过，进入应用」（迁移继续在后台进行）或「重启本地服务并重试」；\n  - 迁移的每一步都有时间限制，超时的步骤会在下次启动时重试，不会卡住启动。\n- 迁移数据目录更可靠（#1276）：\n  - 复制期间不会再有重连把本地服务在旧目录上重新拉起，避免迁移后丢失这段时间写入的数据；\n  - 跳过数据目录里的 socket、管道等特殊文件，以前遇到管道时复制会永久卡住；\n  - 扫描旧版会话改为在后台线程进行，不再冻住窗口。\n- kn 终端里运行的会话实时同步到 LiveAgent（#1278）：以前在 kn 里开始的新会话，要等回合结束十几秒后才出现在会话列表里，已经打开的会话也不会刷新。\n  - 现在几秒内就会出现在列表里，运行期间显示转圈；\n  - 已打开的对话会随 kn 的进度依次显示用户消息、工具调用和最终回答；\n  - 运行期间输入框会提示「正在 kn 中运行」并暂时禁止发送，回合结束后恢复。\n内置 K-brain 的变化\n- 会话同步与防止丢消息（K-brain#192）：kn 在回合进行中就保存进度，backend 几秒内就能发现变化；同一会话同时只允许一个进程运行回合，在 LiveAgent 和 kn 同时操作同一会话时不会再互相覆盖消息。\n- 置顶、归档在回合运行中也能使用（K-brain#190，随 v0.107.29 发布）。\n详见 K-brain v0.107.29、v0.107.30 发布说明。\n完整变更：https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/compare/v2.0.16...v2.0.17","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/LiveAgent/releases/tag/v2.0.17","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","claude-code","codex","large-language-model","llm","mcp"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.17/app.json","detailSha256":"5de18e07f2a9961216a7c7550fa20652667379c2e74fa6ddd697d6b37dd9a0fe","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.17"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.16/app.json","detailSha256":"abc87e4d4664e14a21cdd58a9ea6f39974ab52d7035ccdb86774659fd50f87dc","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.16"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.15/app.json","detailSha256":"24bd844fed8dcfba9907c85f893b156276ae4e4933ce30da2fe92b6b4f0e9d27","releaseDate":"2026-11-08","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.15"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.14/app.json","detailSha256":"d117b9d289de0ea454ea6fdc8a153b3f9ca40ec9326872176c8f2f68a62b7891","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.14"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.13/app.json","detailSha256":"a3da874ac89cddc5a98311cfb3f3e48007a366ead8cda687dfb86b0e712fa1c4","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.13"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.12/app.json","detailSha256":"91b0a2433328333eaabb73b626e7cb3e73ce00bd365bd73afccccc01fbcf3a90","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.12"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.11/app.json","detailSha256":"2779951da20dde65ced855e888853439c0f17a781a64b84c2d7fecae47b70a2c","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.0.11"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.10/app.json","detailSha256":"5ffd3eca4d1ea0e2